{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>A sacred proclamation.</b> Of the root מקרה, as its Targum renders: a proclaimed restriction, regarding food, drink, and clean clothing." "<b>Any labor of service.</b> Labor of servile work is forbidden. And any labor of food preparation is permitted; therefore it is written here <b>any labor of service you shall not do</b>, but regarding Sabbath and Yom Kippur, which are forbidden in all labor, it is written: any labor you shall not do."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:03.253596142Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}